  "summary": "Colonia del Sacramento is a UNESCO-listed old town of cobbled lanes, vintage cars and ivy-covered houses on the Río de la Plata. Walk the Calle de los Suspiros, climb the lighthouse, rent a golf cart to the bullring at Real de San Carlos and watch a slow riverside sunset.",
