  "seasonNote": "Mild spring and autumn are ideal; summer weekends fill with day-trippers.",
  "arrival": "Fast ferries from Buenos Aires take about 75 minutes; buses from Montevideo take 2.5 hours.",
  "gettingAround": "Walk the old town; golf carts or bikes for the coast.",
  "cashTip": "Cards work almost everywhere and foreign cards often get a VAT refund at restaurants.",
